    <statement><p>Write the fraction as a decimal number.</p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{23}{25}}}</m> = <fillin characters="11" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{2}{5}}}</m> = <fillin characters="11" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.92</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.4</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p>To change a fraction to decimal, we divide the numerator by the denominator.</p>
<p><ol label="a.">
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{23}{25}}} = 23 \div 25 = 0.92</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>{{\frac{2}{5}}} = 2 \div 5 = 0.4</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</solution>
